<exercise id="fs-idm188713840">
<problem id="fs-idm198103184">
<para id="fs-idm184960944">সরল করো: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline /> প্রশ্নটি না পারলে আবার দেখো <link target-id="fs-id2317911" document="m81287" />।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm182268624">
<para id="fs-idm200684592"><m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
